OL,3, V -,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,4,G
OL,5,GSeveral police files containing the
OL,6,Gphotographs of sixty terrorist suspects
OL,7,Ghave been delivered to the Belfast
OL,8,Goffice of the Independent newspaper.
OL,10,FThe files were headed RUC Criminal
OL,11,FIntelligence Section. They were later
OL,12,Fhanded to the detectives investigating
OL,13,Falleged collusion between the security
OL,14,Fforces and loyalist paramilitaries.
OL,16,FTwenty-five people in the latest batch
OL,17,Fcome from the Irish Republic. The BBC
OL,18,FNorthern Ireland Correspondent says
OL,19,Fthere may be suspicion these pictures
OL,20,Foriginated with police in the Republic.
OL,21,F
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]CFrom 22-09-89   teletextarchive.com
