OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G5/7
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3, V -,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5,GThe Arab League's peace envoy in
OL,6,GLebanon has announced that Christian
OL,7,Gleader General Aoun has accepted the
OL,8,GLeague's peace plan.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FThe envoy, Mr Lakhdar Ibrahimj, made
OL,11,Fhis announcement after meeting the
OL,12,Fgeneral in a bunker below the ruined
OL,13,Fpresidential palace in east Beirut.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FMr Ibrahimj said he hoped to form a
OL,16,Fcommittee to implement the plan which
OL,17,Fcould have its first meeting tomorrow.
OL,18,F
OL,19,S/FThree people were killed and 16
OL,20,Finjured overnight in four hours of
OL,21,Fheavy shelling in the east.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]CFrom 22-09-89   teletextarchive.com
